          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi Musa yaaha ab'ekicweka ku'oruganda rwa Manaase obuhunguzi bwabo, bwaba obw'ekicweka ky'oruganda rwa Manaase, nk'oku emiryango yaabo yaabaire eri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.13.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.13.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 13:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekyanga kyabo kikaba kiri okuruga Mahanaimu na Bashani yoona n'obugabe bwa Ogi omugabe wa Bashani bwona, na tauni zoona eza Yairi eziri omuri Bashani, endembo makumi mukaaga; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.13.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.13.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 13:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kandi ekicweka kya Gileadi na Ashitaroosi na Edurei, endembo z'omu bugabe bwa Ogi omuri Bashani bikaheebwa aba Makiri, mwene Manaase, ekicweka kya beene Makiri, nk'oku emiryango yaabo yaabaire eri.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.13.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.13.31"
            ]
          }
        }
